# khalafcanonlaw.com: project rules

Site rule for `websites/khalafcanonlaw.com/`. It applies in addition to the global rules in `.cursor/rules/`; where they conflict, the global rules win. Paths are relative to the site folder.

## Site shape
- One-page home: about with portrait, six practice cards, contact. Phone `+961 71 662 444`, email `info@khalafcanonlaw.com`. Office in Dbayeh (`mapQuery` `33.9302222,35.5910556`).
- In The Press uses the blog module: public `/press`, admin menu label "In The Press", `blog.rootKey` = `press`. Listing stays empty until editors add articles.
- Press posts support body links (rich text) and an optional external link (`externalUrl` / `externalLabel`) shown as a button on the article.
- Instagram: `https://www.instagram.com/dr.habibkhalaf/` (Site Settings > Social).

## Design
- Colours from `wwwroot/logo.png`: seal red and gold. Tokens: primary `#8b2e2e` (AA with white), accent `#b89a2e`, navy secondary `#1a2744`.
- Fonts: Playfair Display (headings), Lato (body).
